{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Zero</strong> is a fast-paced, single-player melee action game where the ground beneath you is just as dangerous as the enemies ahead. Armed with a katana\u2014and other deadly melee weapons you may find\u2014you\u2019ll slash your way through relentless waves of foes, upgrading your abilities as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival isn\u2019t just about combat. The map itself shifts and reshapes, creating sudden holes, tricky jumping puzzles, and shifting blocky platforms that force you to adapt on the fly. Use your movement skills\u2014dodges, wall bounces, and acrobatic maneuvers\u2014to stay one step ahead of both the environment and the enemies closing in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843980?t=1765482984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843980?t=1765482984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843980/978767192213efc5ba696f15f1e17ba7088f9b9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765482984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843980/978767192213efc5ba696f15f1e17ba7088f9b9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765482984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sin Zero</strong> is a fast-paced, single-player melee action game where the ground beneath you is just as dangerous as the enemies ahead. Armed with a katana\u2014and other deadly melee weapons you may find\u2014you\u2019ll slash your way through relentless waves of foes, upgrading your abilities as you fight to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But survival isn\u2019t just about combat. The map itself shifts and reshapes, creatin